@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Data & privacy"; }
<section class="card"><div class="card-body p-4"><p class="eyebrow">Your workspace data</p><h1>Data & privacy</h1><p>ProjectFlow stores your registered name and email, account access settings, organization memberships, projects, tasks, comments and notifications.</p><h2 class="h4 mt-4">Who can see your work?</h2><p>Project participants and organization owners can see their authorized project work. Organization members can see their workspace's member directory. Administrators can manage accounts and oversee the application. Notifications remain private to their recipient and require current resource access.</p><h2 class="h4 mt-4">Accounts and history</h2><p>Administrators can deactivate accounts. Project archiving preserves task and activity history. Comments are append-only. This version does not provide account deletion or email delivery. Contact your application operator for account and retention requests.</p><h2 class="h4 mt-4">Cookies</h2><p>Essential cookies keep you signed in, protect submitted forms and carry short-lived success messages. No advertising or analytics integration is included.</p></div></section>
